  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for gRPC assertions in .NET test projects. Takes the single Grpc.Core.Api dependency (the RpcException / StatusCode / Status types the assertions are about). Test-framework-specific assertion entry points live in adapter packages (GrpcAssertions.TUnit ships today; xUnit, NUnit, MSTest adapters are possible if there is demand). AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection. v0.0.1 is a skeleton release that establishes the repository, package identifiers, and quality bar; the full assertion surface ships in v0.1.0.",
